# app/changelog/page.tsx reads CHANGELOG.md at build time (force-static), so it
# must reach the builder stage. .dockerignore filters the build context, not
# just the runtime image — excluding it makes the page render empty with no
# error, because the read falls back to ''.
!CHANGELOG.md
